#: {{ux|en|She goes to a Wiccan '''church''' down the road.}}
#* {{quote-text|en|year=2007|author=Scott A. Merriman|title=Religion and the Law in America|page=313|url=http://books.google.co.uk/books?id=l_8VFygyaDYC&pg=PA312&dq=|passage=Among these, the '''church''' must investigate fundemental questions, {{...}}}}
