====Usage notes====
* Several senses of ''church'' are routinely used in prepositional phrases as a [[bare noun]], without a [[determiner]] or [[article]]. This is like {{m|en|home}} and unlike {{m|en|house}}.
* {{sense|organized religion}} Often capitalized as "(the) Church" without referring to a specific formal institution with that title.

